  // Godot footstep set exports one variation pack per surface (footsteps/grass.tres …). Every one is SHORT (120-200 ms,
  // a 1-17 ms attack, under -40 dB by 150 ms), dry, single-layer (so Variations varies all of it) and gain-set so the
  // set sits together: the hard ones (stone, wood, metal, ice, water) at about -16 dB gated RMS, the soft ones lower.
